    "content": "<article> <h3>User-friendly assert in C++26</h3> <p>Here is a code example using the new assert features:</p> <pre><code class=\"language-cpp\" data-lang=\"cpp\">// https://godbolt.org/z/9sqM7PvWh\nusing Int = int;\nint x = 1, y = 2;\n\nassert(std::is_same&lt;int, Int&gt;::value);\nassert([x, y]() { return x &lt; y; }() == 1);\nassert(std::vector&lt;int&gt;{1, 2, 3}.size() == 3);</code></pre> <p>The assert macro now provides better diagnostics.</p> </article>",
